        <object id="p3_log" label="Log issues and request&#10;correction" description="Preserve the existing exception activity and accept defects found either during source validation or management review. Describe affected source records and ask the responsible source-data owner to correct verified errors. Do not silently repair business values inside a published aggregate." role="Controlling" system="Issue log / correction workflow (conceptual)" inputs="Data-quality result or management source-defect finding&#10;Affected source-record references" outputs="Correction request and issue list" added="false" kind="function" model_id="p3_log" phase="Prepare and validate source data" original_label="Log issues and request correction" tooltip="Log issues and request correction&#10;&#10;Preserve the existing exception activity and accept defects found either during source validation or management review. Describe affected source records and ask the responsible source-data owner to correct verified errors. Do not silently repair business values inside a published aggregate.&#10;&#10;Role: Controlling&#10;&#10;Application: Issue log / correction workflow (conceptual)&#10;&#10;Inputs: Data-quality result or management source-defect finding; Affected source-record references&#10;&#10;Outputs: Correction request and issue list">
