        <object id="p3_advance_query" label="Forecast final tax&#10;by vehicle type" description="For each registered ownership/year segment started by the cutoff, match the case on ownership and tax year only if already created. Use its current issued assessment and boundary readings if available; otherwise use its current accepted estimate only if available, still open and covering the exact segment. Count a missing case or unusable source as incomplete." role="Reporting analyst" system="SQLite / expected_revenue.sql" inputs="Expected ownership/year segments and vehicle types&#10;Cases created by the cutoff&#10;Issued assessments and boundary readings&#10;Accepted estimates and their coverage dates" outputs="April–March billing-year label and vehicle type&#10;Distinct vehicles&#10;Assessed or estimated miles&#10;Expected final tax in GBP&#10;Incomplete segments" added="false" kind="function" model_id="p3_advance_query" phase="Run both analyses" original_label="Forecast final tax by vehicle type" tooltip="Forecast final tax by vehicle type&#10;&#10;For each registered ownership/year segment started by the cutoff, match the case on ownership and tax year only if already created. Use its current issued assessment and boundary readings if available; otherwise use its current accepted estimate only if available, still open and covering the exact segment. Count a missing case or unusable source as incomplete.&#10;&#10;Role: Reporting analyst&#10;&#10;Application: SQLite / expected_revenue.sql&#10;&#10;Inputs: Expected ownership/year segments and vehicle types; Cases created by the cutoff; Issued assessments and boundary readings; Accepted estimates and their coverage dates&#10;&#10;Outputs: April–March billing-year label and vehicle type; Distinct vehicles; Assessed or estimated miles; Expected final tax in GBP; Incomplete segments">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="flow" style="html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=16;fontColor=#243d4a;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;fillColor=#edf7ee;strokeColor=#347b42;strokeWidth=1.3;shadow=0;shape=rectangle;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;perimeter=rectanglePerimeter;">
