        <object id="p3_compile" label="Compile management report" description="Combine the forecast rows and their coverage with the gross adjustments for the same billing year and snapshot. Keep original advance due, expected final tax and cash distinct. Never sum only the complete groups into a grand total." role="Reporting analyst" system="Reporting workspace (conceptual)" inputs="Billing year and type, distinct vehicles, assessed or estimated miles, expected final tax (GBP), incomplete segments&#10;Gross adjustments against original advance due&#10;Coverage and validation statement" outputs="Draft management report" added="true" kind="function" model_id="p3_compile" phase="Compile, review, and revise" original_label="Compile management report" tooltip="Compile management report&#10;&#10;Combine the forecast rows and their coverage with the gross adjustments for the same billing year and snapshot. Keep original advance due, expected final tax and cash distinct. Never sum only the complete groups into a grand total.&#10;&#10;Role: Reporting analyst&#10;&#10;Application: Reporting workspace (conceptual)&#10;&#10;Inputs: Billing year and type, distinct vehicles, assessed or estimated miles, expected final tax (GBP), incomplete segments; Gross adjustments against original advance due; Coverage and validation statement&#10;&#10;Outputs: Draft management report">
