        <object id="notes-subtitle" label="Management reporting and planning" kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=21;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="100" width="1120" height="40" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="notes-summary" label="What final tax do we expect for this billing year, by vehicle type, and is the forecast complete?&#10;Run the forecast and the gross-adjustment analysis on the same validated snapshot." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=16;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="160" width="1120" height="58" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumptions-title" label="Scope and assumptions" kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=21;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="252" width="1120" height="34" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumption-1" label="1. This is a proposed full business-process model. Human correction, review, versioning, and approval workflows are&#10;   conceptual; their storage and automation are not claimed to exist in the current database." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="302" width="1120" height="54" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumption-2" label="2. Use the stored April–March billing-year label. Include each non-empty ownership/year intersection started by the cutoff,&#10;   even if no case exists. Count distinct vehicles per year and type; a handover does not create a second vehicle." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="369" width="1120" height="54" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumption-3" label="3. Use the issued assessment available at the cutoff, else the accepted estimate only for an open, exactly matching segment.&#10;   Report assessed or estimated miles, expected final tax in GBP and incomplete segments. A valid zero counts as complete." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="436" width="1120" height="54" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumption-4" label="4. A missing or late case, or no usable assessment or estimate, withholds the group's miles and tax and the grand total.&#10;   Other complete groups remain visible. Correct the source, extract again and revalidate before release." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="503" width="1120" height="54" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumption-5" label="5. The parallel analysis compares each issued tax with the original advance due (the first accepted demand).&#10;   Sum additions and refunds separately. Neither that comparison nor the forecast measures cash received." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="570" width="1120" height="75" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumption-6" label="6. No statutory deadline, retry limit, tax rate change, or automatic enforcement action is introduced." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="658" width="1120" height="33" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="editing-title" label="Using the editable diagram" kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=21;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="726" width="1120" height="34" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="editing-0" label="• Every process shape, label, connector and satellite object is a native draw.io element." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="775" width="1120" height="29" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="editing-1" label="• The Process page has separate layers for control flow, roles / systems / data, and the title / legend." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="812" width="1120" height="29" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="editing-2" label="• Activity properties contain the full descriptions, roles, applications, inputs and outputs." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="849" width="1120" height="29" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="editing-3" label="• Some visible satellite labels are abbreviated to keep the diagram readable. Full values remain in the properties." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="886" width="1120" height="29" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="editing-4" label="• Blue outlines and connections identify additions or revisions compared with the repository model." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="923" width="1120" height="29" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="editing-5" label="• The offline P3 portal demonstrates the same forecast, coverage checks and correction paths." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="960" width="1120" height="29" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="examples-title" label="2028/29 worked snapshots" kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=21;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="1045" width="1120" height="38" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="examples" label="3 January: two vehicles per type. BEV 21,000 miles / £630; PHEV 18,000 miles / £270. Complete forecast: £900.&#10;Without Ben’s case: BEV still has two vehicles, one incomplete segment and NULL miles and tax. PHEV stays £270; no grand total.&#10;&#10;4 April: 22,000 miles per type; BEV £660 and PHEV £330, no incomplete segments. Final assessed tax: £990.&#10;Five original advances: £1,020. Gross additions: £90; gross refunds: £120. Separate cash check: £960 net received; £30 outstanding." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="1100" width="1120" height="150" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
